// The scythe: slow, wide sweeps with a long reach that hit every enemy in front of you. Made for
// crowds, not duels: a whole group takes each swing, but each swing is slow to come out.
//
//   light, light, light: two sweeps, one each way, then a full spin all around you
//   heavy: the reap, a slow pulling cut that drags the enemies it hits towards you (a negative
//   knockback pulls), ready for the sweeps
//
// It gives less mana back for each point of damage than the other weapons ("mana": it hits many at
// once). followSwing: the blade (the model's +X side) turns about the handle to lead each swing, the
// way the swing goes (and the way a spin or a flip turns the body). The rest pose's roll turns it about
// the handle while no attack runs: -90 has the blade face forward. Fields as in sword.json.
